# ==============================================================================
# D.E.E.P (Dynamic Executive Edge Platform) - Git Ignore Configuration
# Zero-Trust Production & Open Source Standard
# ==============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Credentials, Secrets & Environment Configurations (MANDATORY ZERO-TRUST)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.token
*.pfx
*.cert
*.crt
id_rsa*
change_pg_pass.py

# Personal Identity, Resumes & Documents
*resume*
*Resume*
*.docx

